  \oobeProvisioningEntry\ProvisioningUnsafeToEject:
    Candidate Language=BS-LATN-BA: Još nemojte uklanjati uklonjivi medij.
  \oobeProvisioningEntry\ProvisioningSinglePackageVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=BS-LATN-BA: Alright, setting up your PC...
  \oobeProvisioningEntry\ProvisioningNoPackageVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=BS-LATN-BA: There are no provisioning packages on the removable media. Go back and reconnect your removable media. If that doesn't work, talk to your support person.
  \oobeProvisioningEntry\ProvisioningNoPackageTitle:
    Candidate Language=BS-LATN-BA: Nismo uspjeli pronaći nijedan paket za dodjelu resursa
  \oobeProvisioningEntry\ProvisioningNoPackageLeadingText:
    Candidate Language=BS-LATN-BA: Vratite se i pokušajte ponovo povezati uklonjivi medij. Ako to ne uspije, obratite se osobi zaduženoj za podršku.
  \oobeProvisioningEntry\ProvisioningLabelContent:
    Candidate Language=BS-LATN-BA: Instaliraj pripremni paket za posao ili školu
  \oobeProvisioningEntry\ProvisioningLabel:
    Candidate Language=BS-LATN-BA: Instaliraj pripremni paket
  \oobeProvisioningEntry\ProvisioningEntryVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=BS-LATN-BA: It looks like there are some provisioning packages on your removable media. Do you want to install them now?
